-                "{} imports `{}` at version `{v}`, and {} declares {}. refused: This \
-                     is a build host newer than the target: the loader refuses \
-                     naming the version, whatever the NAME resolves to",
-                object.path,
-                want.name,
-                libc.path,
-                if libc.declares.is_empty() {
